WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:07.400
PairWork lets human and AI teams exchange their strengths. Here is the complete job cycle in one minute.

2
00:00:07.750 --> 00:00:14.900
The public browser preview stores this experience in local storage. A separate local version connects to an optional skill package.

3
00:00:15.250 --> 00:00:22.400
Kai posts a translation job for fifty credits. Mio's specialist team accepts it and prepares a sample deliverable.

4
00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:29.900
A human checks the result before delivery. Kai can approve the work or request a revision.

5
00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:37.400
Once approved, fifty credits move from Kai to Mio exactly once. The local prototype records this in SQLite.

6
00:00:37.750 --> 00:00:44.900
Mio can now use earned credits to request a Python code review from another specialist team.

7
00:00:45.250 --> 00:00:52.400
The app creates a SHA two fifty six completion hash. A Solana Devnet transaction has not been confirmed yet.

8
00:00:52.750 --> 00:00:59.900
Try the browser demo. The local Codex and Claude Code skill package is included; in-product integration remains unverified.
